            <div xml:id="d830">

                <pb facs="0902" n="782" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg782"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.48 Earthquake of 1931/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Moncada</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-03-31T22:41:00-05:45">March 31, 1931—10:41
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 1—2:52 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Earthquake centered at Managua, which has been almost destroyed. Rest of the
                    country undamaged. Am profoundly grateful for your expressions of
                    condolence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. M. Moncada</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
